WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,590 --> 00:00:01,790
I asked Yaqin

2
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:03,670
She said she knew our house was not enough.

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:05,950
It's unreasonable to be willing to make do with one night

4
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,270
What kind of rationality and no rationality?

5
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:10,470
Let’s live our lives behind closed doors and no one else will know.

6
00:00:10,470 --> 00:00:12,270
Now that you have accepted Zhang Jianguo again,

7
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:13,350
Why do you still care about this?

8
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:14,870
But then you have to remarry, that’s all.

9
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:17,460
Yaqin knows what she's doing, so let's talk about it.

10
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:18,740
They are at our house tonight

11
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,660
You saw that you feel bad, but you can still take care of it.

12
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,100
But usually Yaqin lives in the Zhang family

13
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,300
Can you still follow me and keep an eye on me?

14
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,220
Don't you want them to sleep in the same room?

15
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:29,580
Although my little sister looks weak,

16
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:31,020
But I have the idea in my heart to make good money

17
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,620
No matter when I married Zhang Jianguo,

18
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,860
Or stay in Zhang Jianguo after the divorce?

19
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:37,580
You've never heard my words before, so that's the case

20
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:48,710
Then let her be, Yaqin

21
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:53,050
Why don't you wash our feet too? It's not as difficult as being a human being.

22
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,050
It's harder to be a man

23
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:55,210
I got up early this morning

24
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:56,490
Both fishing and selling prawns

25
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:58,330
When I got home, I kept mentioning that I would take you back to your parents’ home.

26
00:00:58,330 --> 00:01:00,850
Who is this running around for in the end?

27
00:01:00,850 --> 00:01:03,090
No one feels sorry for me, I even want to wash my feet

28
00:01:03,090 --> 00:01:04,250
Relax and there's no one to help you
